{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45516","headline":"雪十二韵 · 可止","name":"雪十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落处咸过尺，翛然物象凄。\n瑞凝金殿上，寒甚玉关西。\n润比江河普，明将日月齐。\n凌云花顶腻，锁径竹梢低。\n出谷樵童怯，归林野鸟迷。\n煮茶融破练，磨墨染成黳。\n陷兔埋平泽，和鱼冻合溪。\n入楼消酒力，当槛写诗题。\n道路依凭马，朝昏委托鸡。\n洞深猿作族，松亚鹤移栖。\n及夏清岩穴，经春溜石梯。\n丰年兼泰国，天道育黔黎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"可止","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45516.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45516","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}